WEBVTT

NOTE Module: Git & GitHub

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.639
In Module 10, we examine professional version control with Git and GitHub. We master the underlying object model, branching workflows, and conflict resolution.

2
00:00:10.639 --> 00:00:19.967
Interactive rebasing allows developers to clean up work-in-progress commits into atomic units with clear messages, producing an auditable project history.

3
00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:29.908
Never force push to shared branches. It destroys collaborator commits. Enable GitHub branch protection rules to enforce pull requests and automated tests.

4
00:00:29.908 --> 00:00:39.034
Your project submissions require valid GitHub repositories. Master Git hygiene to streamline reviews and record authentic collaboration evidence.
